# NOTE: data/ IS committed on purpose. It is the run of record: the per-engine
# OCR transcriptions (*.txt), the gold (*.fields.json / *.gold.txt), and the
# per-page latency manifests (_run*.json). The no-GPU reproduce path scores
# these offline. Document images are NOT committed (license + size); see
# docs/DATASETS.md for how to fetch them for the from-scratch path.

